{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hordes of Cutelings are coming\u2026 and they just want cuddles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot them in the face before they get too close, or risk being overwhelmed by pure, relentless cuteness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294950/extras/aef8d85c6ac1bc945c2f132c6097fd3c.poster.avif?t=1771508633\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294950/extras/aef8d85c6ac1bc945c2f132c6097fd3c.webm?t=1771508633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294950/extras/aef8d85c6ac1bc945c2f132c6097fd3c.mp4?t=1771508633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the Villain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive fast-paced 30 to 90-second roguelite rounds on randomly generated maps, each with unique hazards\u2014swamps, booby traps, toxic rivers, freezing cold, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Fighter!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 unique characters, each with their own weapons, stats, and special skills. Every run feels different! Conquer challenges at various difficulties and unlock them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die, Upgrade, Repeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is just another step to power. Upgrade your favorite weapons, invest in your skill tree, and come back stronger to slaughter even more cute things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294950/extras/6268fa1ae2dd23e1034f70d19bfae457.poster.avif?t=1771508633\" width=123 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294950/extras/6268fa1ae2dd23e1034f70d19bfae457.webm?t=1771508633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"R.I.P 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/47e9eac49990e719057f9b006ba6c478ff4289dc.jpg"},{"name":"R.I.P 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/8318748afeb100ded6e482a02cdc5223150ebd50.jpg"},{"name":"R.I.P 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/09ce015fb85cb90ac294527cc181b1ef916a6814.jpg"},{"name":"Genocide 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/8d52bef31b4cc297388dc51c29ddc2183c450340.jpg"},{"name":"Genocide 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/aae87d88db67aa2f8b932d74fc101a841274e601.jpg"},{"name":"Genocide 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/3b83368f8989d52f2a68689d78a1fb430dae55bd.jpg"},{"name":"Easy-Peasy! 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/2fbf9cdfc30d7ca17f90945cfe80b6fa66f7d7fd.jpg"},{"name":"Easy-Peasy! 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/5ecad4bf29cc383f61d940fd5b9ad753e2a15f82.jpg"},{"name":"Easy-Peasy! 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/ce2748ee8eba2e6617d268923f91f8a49b7b4da3.jpg"},{"name":"Easy-Peasy! 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2294950/d56eeb8189ee32862f2b656377b6bb438e490359.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2294950?t=1771508633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2294950?t=1771508633","capsule_image":